      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "Doing more testing with a performance overlay and it doesn't seem to have anything to do with temperature (it will happen at any temperature) or CPU load (all 8 CPU cores will be at ~20% load)\n\nThis phone's OS has a \"game booster\" plugin but configuring that for performance doesn't change anything, nor does setting it to not interfere. \n\nAll background apps are also closed and will automatically be cleared when resources are low. \n\nAmount of people in instance, udon script load, avatar complexity, network integrity, time of day, astrological sign, etc also seems to have no effect at all",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    },
